  offerText: Purchase this crate of rare, imported fruits. They require significant
    storage space, but eating them will grant you unparalleled physical vitality
    and joy.
  acceptResultText: You buy the bulky crate and eat a delicious exotic fruit. You
    feel incredibly healthy and absolutely euphoric!
  rejectResultText: You refuse to buy food from a sketchy traveler. Your room stays
    clean, but you settle for a bland, tasteless dinner.
  acceptedDelayedText: The remaining fruit rotted at an unnatural speed, releasing
    a highly toxic miasma into your room! You violently vomit and develop a terrifying
    fever.
